Human Focus – Creativity - Excellence
We’re seeking individuals with a purpose and passion for life and who are looking for meaningful work that will make a real difference. Join our team today!
Reporting to the Director of Care or Health and Wellness Manager, the Staff Educator's role is to identify training needs and then design, develop and deliver required training to team members.
Key Responsibilities
Identifies the educational and training needs in the facility to ensure quality of care and services;
Designs, develops and coordinates the delivery of Staff Development Programs to meet these needs;
Ensures good resident outcome and satisfaction through training needs of staff;
